        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ios]",
        "section": "os",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "iOS Developer Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Feature | macOS | iOS |\n|---------|-------|-----|\n| `fork()` | Yes (POSIX) | No — not allowed in sandboxed apps |\n| `exec()` | Yes | No |\n| JIT compilation | Yes (with entitlement) | No (prior to iOS 14.2); restricted even now |\n| Multiple user accounts | Yes | No (single user; enterprise managed) |\n| Unsigned code execution | Yes (without SIP) | Never — all code must be signed |\n| Dynamic library loading | Yes (developer dylibs) | No — only system dylibs; app frameworks must be embedded |\n| Terminal / shell access | Yes | No |\n| Sandbox | Optional (App Store only) | Mandatory — every app, always |\n| GUI customization | Menubar, Dock, etc. | Fixed: SpringBoard controls all |"
    },
