        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "iOS Developer Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nSpringBoard (com.apple.springboard)\n├── Home Screen grid of app icons\n├── Notification Center\n├── Control Center\n├── Lock Screen\n├── App switcher\n└── Manages app lifecycle signals → your app's UIApplicationDelegate\n```"
    },
